[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878730205","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106364#issuecomment-2878730205","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106364","id":2878730205,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rle_d","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-14T05:34:07Z","updated_at":"2025-05-14T05:34:07Z","body":"This warning is not produced because obviously accessing a static variable cannot be named \"called\".\n\nIf we wanted to introduce a similar warning, it should be named something like `ACCESS_STATIC_VAR_ON_INSTANCE`. Or we could introduce a generic `ACCESS_STATIC_ON_INSTANCE` and deprecate `STATIC_CALLED_ON_INSTANCE`. However, this (softly?) breaks compatibility, users may need to update their project settings and `@warning_ignore`s.\n\nNote that via an instance you can access not only static functions and variables, but also constants, enums, and inner classes (if I remember correctly).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2878730205/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881894699","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106364#issuecomment-2881894699","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106364","id":2881894699,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6rxjkr","user":{"login":"Meorge","id":9957987,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5NTc5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9957987?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge","html_url":"https://github.com/Meorge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Meorge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T00:32:29Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T00:32:29Z","body":"I like the idea of `ACCESS_STATIC_ON_INSTANCE`, personally. It seems like the iffy behaviors are so similar that it'd make sense to group them under a single warning, and I'm not sure how many people would be specifically trying to ignore the `STATIC_CALLED_ON_INSTANCE` warning. If we were to go this route, having it also trigger for constants, enums, and inner classes would make sense too, IMO.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2881894699/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]